@startuml Explore-Workspace-Map
!theme plain
title Explore workspace — how the pieces fit together

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #71717A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam PackageBorderColor #E4E4E7
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

legend bottom right
  |= Lane |= Focus |
  | Evolution | Past → Now → Next for the meta catalog |
  | Integration | Shared platforms vs product surfaces |
  | Migration | Executable moves (git, brand, docs sync) |
endlegend

' ── Evolution ─────────────────────────────────────────────
package "1. Evolution" as evo #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Past**\nIndependent remotes\nLegacy names (e.g. WhatsFeed)\nNested .git under apps" as past #F4F4F5
  rectangle "**Now**\nMeta repo **explore** (single Git root)\nLiving docs per project\n(C4 · Glossary · Story Map)" as now #ECFDF5
  rectangle "**Next**\nDeeper IAM OIDC for siblings\nMore AI reuse via BFF/ACL\nOnboard more whitelist roots" as next #EFF6FF
  past -right-> now
  now -right-> next
}

' ── Integration ───────────────────────────────────────────
package "2. Integration (catalogued products)" as integ #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Explore IAM**\nShared identity / policy / STS\nOIDC Relying Parties (planned multi-app)" as iam #EEF2FF
  rectangle "**Explore AI**\nChat · RAG · tools · eval\nPublished Language for peers" as ai #ECFDF5
  rectangle "**Explore Chat**\nFeed · messaging · calls\nNest BFF → Explore AI (ACL)" as chat #F0F9FF
  rectangle "**Explore Commerce**\nShop · admin · API" as commerce #FFFBEB
  rectangle "**Explore Lowcode**\nCanvas · themes · export" as lowcode #FFF7ED

  iam -[hidden]down- ai
  iam -down-> chat : OIDC / SSO
  iam -down-> commerce : OIDC / SSO
  iam -down-> lowcode : OIDC / SSO
  iam -down-> ai : OIDC / SSO
  chat -right-> ai : BFF + ACL\nPublished Language
  commerce -[hidden]right- lowcode
}

note as N_clients
  **Client rule:** browsers / mobile call the product API only.
  Do not call Python sidecars or Explore AI directly from the client.
end note

' ── Migration ─────────────────────────────────────────────
package "3. Migration checklist" as mig #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Brand / remote**\npublic → **explore**\nProduct paths **explore-***" as m1 #FEF3C7
  rectangle "**Nested Git**\nApp .git → **.git.local**\nbefore staging into meta" as m2 #FEF3C7
  rectangle "**Docs sync**\nWhitelist only\n(README · Glossary · C4 · Story Map)" as m3 #FEF3C7
  rectangle "**Uncatalogued local trees**\nDefault-deny until onboard\n(.gitignore + Projects table)" as m4 #FEF3C7
  m1 -[hidden]right- m2
  m2 -[hidden]right- m3
  m3 -[hidden]right- m4
}

note as N_candidates
  **Local / not catalogued (examples only):**
  explore-portfolio · three-explore · workflow-editor · …
  Not a delivery commitment until whitelisted.
end note

evo -[hidden]down- integ
integ -[hidden]down- mig
N_clients .. integ
N_candidates .. mig

@enduml
